9	 *
10	 * A Stream Deck is never off, so a socket held whenever the plugin was
11	 * configured would be a socket held around the clock for nothing. This is
12	 * the state the streamer enters instead: nothing is open until it is
13	 * pressed, and pressing it again closes everything.
14	 */
15	@action({ UUID: "com.scrthq.runlog.connect" })
